# Markdown docs and SQL migrations are SOURCE-OF-TRUTH and MUST be tracked.
# They were previously ignored which prevented cross-agent visibility of
# CODE_REVIEW.md / FIXES_PROGRESS.md / supabase/migrations/*.sql. If you
# need to exclude a personal scratch doc, use a `*.local.md` suffix or
# keep it in a folder you add explicitly here.

.env*.local
*.local.md

# Obsidian — open the repo (or the memory dir) as a vault to browse the
# markdown docs + [[wikilinks]] as a graph. The vault config is per-machine
# app state, not source of truth, so it must NOT be tracked. The docs
# themselves stay tracked above.
.obsidian/

# Supabase CLI transient cache (project-ref, pooler URL, versions) — never commit.
supabase/.temp/

# Generated by the production Docker build from verified source.
build-info.json
